## 10. API RESPONSE SHAPE — ALWAYS USE THESE EXACTLY

### Success (single item)
```json
{ "success": true, "item": { ... } }
```

### Success (list)
```json
{ "success": true, "items": [ ... ], "total": 42 }
```

### Error (all errors, all endpoints)
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code":    "SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE_ERROR_CODE",
    "message": "Human-readable message shown to user",
    "status":  404
  }
}
```

Never return any other shape. `useData` and `useMutation` hooks expect this shape.
Never return FastAPI's default `{"detail": "..."}` error format — always use the shape above.

